        <text>&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Dear {!$Record.Account.Name__c},&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
I am writing to inform you about the cancellation of your application for the {!$Record.Product__r.Name} programme at Dorset College that was due to start on {!$Record.start_date__c}. I regret to inform you that your application has been cancelled due to non-payment of the required fees.
&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;

As per our records, we have not received the necessary payment to secure your place in the program. We understand that there could be various reasons for the delay in payment, but it is imperative that the fees are paid on time to secure a place in the programme. We would like to remind you that timely payment of fees is a crucial aspect of the sales process, and we cannot guarantee your place in the programme if the fees are not paid in a timely manner.
&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
If you still wish to pursue your studies at Dorset College, we would be happy to receive a new application from you, along with the necessary fees, once you are ready to proceed. Our sales team is always available to assist you with any questions or concerns.
&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Sincerely,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;strong&gt;Dorset College&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;7,8 Belvedere Place, D01 EV27&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Dublin - Ireland&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;www.dorset.ie&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
